                                                         skos:scopeNote "This sub-class of E55 Type is intended to provide for the classification of iconography on epigraphic supports, using e.g. https://www.getty.edu/research/tools/vocabularies/aat/"^^xsd:string .


###  https://www.getty.edu/research/tools/vocabularies/aat/SupportType
