                                                                    skos:scopeNote "This sub-class of E55 Type is intended to provide for the classification of Epigraphic Supports, the physical carriers of an epont:Inscription, such as is provided by https://www.getty.edu/research/tools/vocabularies/aat/"^^xsd:string .


